OL,7,     FJosie Gibson and the team are in  
OL,8,     FBrighton helping Dan, whose home  
OL,9,     Fhas been taken over by his        
OL,10,     Ffiancee's stash of vintage        
OL,11,     Ftreasures. Natacha used to run an 
OL,12,     Fonline vintage shop, but since the
OL,13,     Farrival of their baby everything  
OL,14,     Fhas been put on hold. As a result,
OL,15,     Fone room is now full of old stock 
OL,16,     Fand new dad Dan wants it gone to  
